    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est la cata !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006C00610020006300610074006100200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon Scobolide est hors de contrôle\nen pleine rue !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E002000530063006F0062006F006C006900640065002000650073007400200068006F0072007300200064006500200063006F006E0074007200F4006C0065000A0065006E00200070006C00650069006E0065002000720075006500200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il risque de percuter un être humain\nou un Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C002000720069007300710075006500200064006500200070006500720063007500740065007200200075006E002000EA007400720065002000680075006D00610069006E000A006F007500200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "S’il te plaît, affronte-le pour l’arrêter !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005320190069006C00200074006500200070006C006100EE0074002C00200061006600660072006F006E00740065002D006C006500200070006F007500720020006C201900610072007200EA00740065007200200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bobolide !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F0062006F006C006900640065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scoco...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530063006F0063006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouf ! Il s’est enfin arrêté !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500660020002100200049006C00200073201900650073007400200065006E00660069006E002000610072007200EA007400E900200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non mais, ça ne va pas de laisser un Scobolide\nrouler comme ça en pleine ville ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Houla... Elle n’est pas contente...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F0075006C0061002E002E002E00200045006C006C00650020006E2019006500730074002000700061007300200063006F006E00740065006E00740065002E002E002E001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous, les Poings de la Justice, on se bat\npour l’abolition des zones sauvages et pour<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nla coexistence avec les Pokémon sauvages.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous cherchez à montrer que les Pokémon sont\ndangereux en laissant rouler le vôtre en ville ?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSachez que les Poings de la Justice n’acceptent\npas ce genre d’action !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 174
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais non !\nCe n’est pas du tout ce que vous pensez !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006E006F006E00200021000A004300650020006E2019006500730074002000700061007300200064007500200074006F00750074002000630065002000710075006500200076006F00750073002000700065006E00730065007A00200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon Scobolide s’est tout d’un coup mis en boule\net il est parti en roulant comme un fou.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je vous jure, je respecte la justice ! Surtout\nses poings !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200076006F007500730020006A007500720065002C0020006A00650020007200650073007000650063007400650020006C00610020006A0075007300740069006300650020002100200053007500720074006F00750074000A00730065007300200070006F0069006E0067007300200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que ce soit à dessein ou non, le comportement\nde votre Pokémon était très dangereux !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Au nom des Poings de la Justice,\nje vais vous donner une leçon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100750020006E006F006D002000640065007300200050006F0069006E006700730020006400650020006C00610020004A007500730074006900630065002C000A006A00650020007600610069007300200076006F0075007300200064006F006E006E0065007200200075006E00650020006C006500E7006F006E0020002100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ? Gardez vos poings où ils sont ! Je n’aime\npas les trucs qui font peur ou qui font mal...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Première leçon : il va falloir que vous en appreniez\nplus sur votre Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Scobolide peuvent être très agressifs.\nÀ la moindre contrariété, ils se roulent en boule<U+0010><U+0001>븀\net foncent sur tout ce qui bouge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Pokémon obéissent aux Dresseurs\net Dresseuses ayant un rang Z-A élevé.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Poings de la Justice vous entraîneront\njusqu’à ce que vous soyez capable d’arrêter votre<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nScobolide par vous-même. Bon courage !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... À vos ordres !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E002000C000200076006F00730020006F0072006400720065007300200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh là là... Il va falloir que je m’entraîne\navec ce Nivis, là ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006C00E00020006C00E0002E002E002E00200049006C002000760061002000660061006C006C006F0069007200200071007500650020006A00650020006D20190065006E00740072006100EE006E0065000A00610076006500630020006300650020004E0069007600690073002C0020006C00E00020003F001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle histoire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C006C006500200068006900730074006F00690072006500200021001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour le bien de mon Pokémon, je dois devenir\nun meilleur Dresseur.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
